plv8 (3.2.5-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Update to upstream 3.2.5 with the pinned, verified V8 source bundle.
  * Declare the V8 compiler, CMake and pkg-config build dependencies.
  * Rebase the V8 flags and architecture stack-scanner build fixes.
  * Order LLVM compilation after generated configuration headers.

