plv8 (3.2.4-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * https://github.com/plv8/plv8/releases/tag/v3.2.4
  * Consolidate the build fixes into a single plv8-3.2.4.patch
  * Preserve distribution C++ flags when building the bundled V8 engine
  * Build the bundled V8 engine with line-table debug information only (-g1)
  * Link the architecture stack scanner into mksnapshot and the final module
  * Build only the bundled V8 libraries required by the extension

